BCC_Q({"y": 2018, "n": 3, "part": "A", "topic": "pat", "title": "Beaver Graffiti", "answer": 3, "story": "<p>Beaver graffiti consists of three different symbols: <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/>, <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/>, and <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/>.<\/p>\n<p>Sequences of symbols are built using two steps:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>One of the symbols is drawn once or twice.<\/li>\n<li>One of the symbols is is drawn once to the left of the current\nsequence and once to the right of the current sequence.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Step 1 happens first and exactly one time. Step 2 may happen any\nnumber of times. Here are five examples:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/><\/li>\n<\/ul>", "question": "<p>Which of the following is <span><strong>not<\/strong><\/span> an\nexample of beaver graffiti?<\/p>\n<ol class=\"mc\">\n<li><img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/><\/li>\n<\/ol>", "answerHtml": "<p>(D) <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/><\/p>", "explanation": "<p>Option A can be built as follows:<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p><img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\rightarrow\\)<\/span> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Option B can be built as follows:<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p><img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\rightarrow\\)<\/span> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\rightarrow\\)<\/span> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Option C can be built as follows:<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p><img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\rightarrow\\)<\/span> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\rightarrow\\)<\/span> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <span class=\"math inline\">\\(\\rightarrow\\)<\/span> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/> <img alt=\"fish\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:100px\"/> <img alt=\"flower\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:80px\"/> <img alt=\"leaf\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50px\"/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>If it was possible to build Option D, then Step 1 must involve the\nfish because there is only one fish. Then, each time Step 2 happens, the\nsame number of leaves must be drawn but there are four leaves to the\nleft of the fish and five to the right of the fish. Thus Option D cannot\nbe built.<\/p>", "connections": "<p>A <em>palindrome<\/em> is a word, phrase, number, or other sequence of\ncharacters which reads the same backwards as forwards, such as noon or\nracecar. Palindromes play a role in our understanding of DNA and human\ngenetics studied by <span><em>computational biologists<\/em><\/span>.<\/p>\n<p>More generally, in computer science, <em>formal languages<\/em> and\n<em>automata theory<\/em> provide ways to express the rules that generate\nsequences of characters (called <em>words<\/em>). They also provide\n<em>models of computation<\/em> to help us understand how complex a\nlanguage of words is.<\/p>\n<p>In this problem, graffiti is a word and the task is to recognize\npalindromes. This problem is possible to solve for relatively short\nwords. However, even today’s most powerful computers would require an\ninfinite amount of memory to solve this problem for words that are\narbitrarily long.<\/p>", "mc": 1});